This is a collection of YANIs by users of the #nethack IRC channel on
freenode.net. Please excuse any old ideas that may be present.

[1]: A cursed Amulet of Yendor should weld to your hand when you wield
it --SpeedEvil
[why not have any arbitrary cursed metal object weld to your hand when
wielded? -az]

[2]: Travelers' checks for tourists. Won't be stolen by l's. Don't get
counted with your visible gold. They are generated bearing the name of
the original tourist and can only be redeemed for goods/services by the
named tourist (so worthless in bones piles). --azgor

[3]: Breaking a potion with force bolt as a wizard should occasionally
produce "Wizard shot the potion!" as the message. --Grunt

[4]: Water elementals should rust iron weapons and armor.
--Dentarthurdent

[5]: Reading a tin should give a message "This tin has no label" or
something like that. Maybe create some (low) percentage of tins that
can be identified by reading the label. --avian

[6]: Apply a (battle-)axe to a box or chest to break it without
damaging the axe. --Dentarthurdent

[7]: When attacking rusting/rotting/corroding monsters, "Your $weapon
is not affected" shouldn't repeat while you're still wielding the same
weapon. --Dentarthurdent

[8]: Attempting to genocide an ungenocidable monster should ensure that
monster is hostile when you encounter it. --jmst

[9]: Inventory management for pets. This could be as simple as #give
and #take commands or something as complex as a menu driven interface.
My goal is to be able to take things out of my dog's mouth or to hand
armor to my pet Archon without having to wait a year for them to drop
or pick-up the desired items. --azgor

[10]: (10 contd.) ...but taking something from your pet reduces
tameness. --azgor

[11]: an artifact "oLS of some kind. --lament

[12]: in the same vain as poly with DSM on goes to corresponding
dragon, poly with a complete set (helm, body, gloves, boots) of
thoroughly rusty metal armor turns you into a Rust Monster, Complete
set of armor enchanted to -3 or below turns you into a Disenchanter (im
sure more could be added) --Xarann

[13]: Make it a configurable option, possibility to make any stack of
items on the ground more than just 1 but less than the amount required
for"many" show up as "You see few items here", saving you to skip the
-more- when walking around many slain monsters --Xarann

[14]: Flux Dragon - just like a normal dragon... but resists polymorph
and breathes as a wand of polymorph. --Calamarain

[15]: Genociding green slimes should prevent you turning into one when
slimed. --jmst

[16]: "_" (travel) should look at the map, not at the screen (ie find
stairs hidden by darts) --Botje

[17]: #offer the Amulet to Croesus as an alternate ending. Acquire the
status of Prince, Duke, treasurer, etc. --SpeedEvil


